verdict SyncGitHubRepositories: The poll runs per binding as specified, but the input has no binding field.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-github/src/types/GitHubOperation.ts#SyncGitHubRepositories, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-github/src/operations/sync.ts#syncRepoBinding]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-github/src/operations/sync-poll.test.ts]
  note: |
    The input is `ConnectorSpec.SyncInput` (`connection`, `priority`); there is no `binding?: Ref<Cursor>` to poll one
    binding, and the handler always runs `Binding.syncAll`. Errors are `GitHubRepoInaccessibleError` /
    `GitHubRepoUnresolvedError` and HTTP errors, not the spec's named set.
```

